      "teaser": "Never again having to puzzle where the good ammunition went.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/LPGdS3eHh4aAv8NvbvrZ2awmkM2HxMYf20NPEm5Y.png",
      "downloads": 2220,
      "favourites_count": 22,
      "description": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Originally, this was part of my debugging tools, but I found it so useful during normal gameplay that I spun it off from it.<br />\nIt adds a simple button that unloads all magazines in stash, including those loaded in weapons.<br />\nThe ammo gets dumped in the same way as the regular unload action -&gt; same container the magazine is in, if not possible (because it’s in a magcase) the parent container.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maschine34675/UnloadAllMagazines/refs/heads/main/button.png\" alt=\"Example Picture\" /></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>As usual, unzip to your SPT folder</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Let me know if you run into any problems or have suggestions for improvement.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2739/unloadallmagazines",
